    "text": "21 hours ago Looking for something useful or fun without spending a dime? Here are a few freebies available right now around Potomac and nearby neighborhoods.\nBoxes of Tennis Balls Two boxes filled with over 200 used tennis balls — perfect if your dogs love to play fetch or for practice sessions. Located in Highland Stone, Rockville, MD .\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nWest Elm Coffee Table A West Elm coffee table measuring 44\" wide x 24\" deep x 16\" tall . It’s sturdy and in fair used condition, with some cosmetic marks from removed corner pads. Free for pickup in Potomac, MD .\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nKids Trampoline with Handle A blue mini trampoline with a safety handle , great for indoor play. Shows some wear on the padding but still usable. Located in Regency, Potomac, MD .\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nNETGEAR Wireless-G Router WGR614 An older NETGEAR Wireless-G router , still in its original box. Works for basic or legacy internet setups . Pickup in Hunting Hill, Potomac, MD .\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nFree items like these tend to go fast, so if something catches your eye, reach out to the poster soon!\nPlease note: Availability changes quickly. Some items listed here may have already been claimed, and links may no longer be active. Contact the poster directly for the most up-to-date information.\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
